  <Thumbnail>0bb24b25-57e3-48a7-b860-b3fbe3d93a15</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="25-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (very confusing documentation.  littered with inconsistencies.  charts contain no information about RGBW pixels and options for white beam pixels are different to the menu system.  made best guess.  also note only one RDM mode ID is provided for each mode.  there should be different IDs to account for whether pixels are enabled or not)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="29-11-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's (many are currently missing)" Version="21" />
  <History Date="03-12-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added most of the missing Atlabase ID's." Version="22" />
  <History Date="04-12-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added missing Atlabase ID for White Beam 12 Pix." Version="23" />
